Lost in a Spanish-speaking city? Learn these 3 for buses 🚌
In Mexico, city buses are often called "camiones."

Today's phrases:
• la parada de autobús = the bus stop
• cerca / lejos = near / far
• ¿va al centro? = does it go downtown?

